ll1:ElecRelAttribute     a assr:Reliability   ; warrant:hasName "Electrical and alarm — reliability"@en .

ll1:NavigationFunction      assr:hasAssuranceAttribute ll1:NavSafetyAttribute , ll1:NavCyberAttribute , ll1:NavAvailAttribute , ll1:NavRelAttribute .
